==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|sh}} {{m|la|tragoedia}}, from the {{etyl|grc|sh}} {{m|grc|τραγῳδία||epic play, tragedy}}, from {{m|grc|τράγος||male goat}} + {{m|grc|ᾠδή||song}}, a reference to the goat-satyrs of the theatrical plays of the [[Dorians]].

